    Script Path: set3/Jenkinsfile

7.  Click Save.

PART D – Run the Pipeline

1.  Open Python-CICD-Pipeline.
2.  Click Build Now.
3.  Open the latest build.
4.  Click Console Output.

Expected stages: Checkout Install Dependencies Automated Testing
Deployment

